#. home.history.gallery.202125thanniversary
#: content/_index.md:0 i18n/en.yaml:201
msgid "KDE's 25th Anniversary"
msgstr "Ulang Tahun KDE yang ke-25"

#. home.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:2
msgid ""
"KDE is 25 years old! Come celebrate with us, attend our talks, join our "
"offline meetups, check out the history of the project — and play with some "
"of historic landmark desktops and software, and get some really cool merch!"
msgstr ""
"KDE telah berusia 25 tahun! Mari rayakan bersama kami, hadiri diskusi kami, "
"bergabunglah dengan pertemuan luring kami, simak sejarah proyek ini - dan "
"cobalah bermain dengan beberapa desktop dan perangkat lunak bersejarah, dan "
"dapatkan beberapa pernak-pernik yang sangat keren!"

#. home.activities.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:9
msgid ""
"<p>Join our fireside talks and meet other KDE friends and enthusiasts.</p>\n"
"<p><b>NOTE:</b> Links to the actual talks will appear here shortly before "
"each chat starts.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Bergabunglah dengan obrolan hangat kami dan temui teman dan penggemar KDE "
"lainnya.</p>\n"
"<p><b>CATATAN:</b> Tautan ke sesi obrolan akan muncul di sini sesaat sebelum "
"obrolan dimulai.</p>"

#. home.activities.fireside
#: i18n/en.yaml:16
msgid "Fireside Chats"
msgstr "Obrolan Hangat"

#. home.activities.fireside.1
#: i18n/en.yaml:18
msgid "October 14, at 17:00 UTC: KDE e.V. Board"
msgstr "14 Oktober, pukul 17:00 UTC: Dewan KDE e.V."

#. home.activities.fireside.1.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:20
msgid ""
"Aleix, Lydia, Eike, Adriaan and Neofytos are the KDE volunteers that run "
"[KDE e.V.](https://ev.kde.org/), the foundation that supports the KDE "
"Community in all organizational, financial and legal matters. In this "
"fireside chat we sit down with all five of them to talk about KDE's history, "
"achievements and where they think KDE is headed. We will also dive into what "
"it means to support the KDE Community for almost 25 years."
msgstr ""
"Aleix, Lydia, Eike, Adriaan dan Neofytos adalah para sukarelawan KDE yang "
"menjalankan [KDE e.V.](https://ev.kde.org/), sebuah yayasan yang mendukung "
"Komunitas KDE dalam segala hal yang berhubungan dengan organisasi, keuangan "
"dan hukum. Dalam obrolan ringan kali ini, kami duduk bersama mereka berlima "
"untuk membicarakan sejarah KDE, pencapaian, dan kemana arah KDE. Kami juga "
"akan membahas tentang apa artinya mendukung Komunitas KDE selama hampir 25 "
"tahun."

#. home.activities.fireside.2
#: i18n/en.yaml:27
msgid "October 15, at 18:00 UTC: Jeri Ellsworth"
msgstr "15 Oktober, pukul 18:00 UTC: Jeri Ellsworth"

#. home.activities.fireside.2.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:29
msgid ""
"Jeri Ellsworth, self-taught electronics engineer, race driver, and maker and "
"inventor supreme, will give us a glimpse into her latest project: [Tilt 5]"
"(https://www.tiltfive.com/), an augmented reality system for collaborative "
"tabletop gaming. Yes, it is awesome as it sounds."
msgstr ""
"Jeri Ellsworth, insinyur elektronik otodidak, pembalap, dan pembuat serta "
"penemu terkemuka, akan memberi kita gambaran sekilas tentang proyek "
"terbarunya: [Tilt 5](https://www.tiltfive.com/), sebuah sistem realitas "
"tertambah untuk permainan meja kolaboratif. Ya, ini sangat mengagumkan "
"seperti kedengarannya."

#. home.activities.fireside.3
#: i18n/en.yaml:34
msgid "October 23, at 15:00 UTC: Massimo Stella"
msgstr "23 Oktober, pukul 15:00 UTC: Massimo Stella"

#. home.activities.fireside.3.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:36
msgid ""
"Massimo Stella of Kdenlive will talk about how KDE's video editor came to "
"be, where it is now and what we can look forward to in the future of open "
"source film-making."
msgstr ""
"Massimo Stella dari Kdenlive akan berbicara tentang bagaimana editor video "
"KDE muncul, di mana posisinya sekarang dan apa yang dapat kita nantikan di "
"masa depan dalam pembuatan film berbasis sumber terbuka."

#. home.activities.fireside.4
#: i18n/en.yaml:40
msgid "October 25, at 17:00 UTC: Matthias Ettrich"
msgstr "25 Oktober, pukul 17:00 UTC: Matthias Ettrich"

#. home.activities.fireside.4.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:42
msgid ""
"25 years ago Matthias Ettrich sent a now [famous email](https://groups."
"google.com/g/de.comp.os.linux.misc/c/SDbiV3Iat_s/m/zv_D_2ctS8sJ?pli=1) to "
"the de.comp.os.linux.misc news group. In that message, Matthias asked "
"developers to join him in building a Kool Desktop Environment (and a set of "
"apps to match), all geared towards end users. We will chat with Matthias "
"about how KDE started, dig into the details and fascinating anecdotes that "
"shaped the project and our community in its early days, and discover his "
"perspective on what has become of his vision since then."
msgstr ""
"25 tahun yang lalu Matthias Ettrich mengirimkan sebuah email yang sekarang "
"menjadi terkenal (https://groups.google.com/g/de.comp.os.linux.misc/c/"
"SDbiV3Iat_s/m/zv_D_2ctS8sJ?pli=1) ke grup berita de.comp.os.linux.misc. "
"Dalam pesan tersebut, Matthias mengajak para pengembang untuk bergabung "
"dengannya dalam membangun sebuah Kool Desktop Environment (dan seperangkat "
"aplikasi yang sesuai), yang ditujukan untuk pengguna akhir. Kami akan "
"berbincang-bincang dengan Matthias tentang bagaimana KDE dimulai, menggali "
"detail dan anekdot menarik yang membentuk proyek dan komunitas kami di masa-"
"masa awal, dan menemukan perspektifnya tentang apa yang telah terjadi pada "
"visinya sejak saat itu."

#. home.activities.fireside.registration
#: i18n/en.yaml:51
msgid "Register here"
msgstr "Daftar disini"

#. home.activities.fireside.ifregistered
#: i18n/en.yaml:53
msgid "The room opens shortly before the beginning of the talk."
msgstr "Ruangan dibuka sesaat sebelum acara dimulai."

#. home.activities.fireside.access
#: i18n/en.yaml:55
msgid "Access room"
msgstr "Ruang akses"

#. home.activities.meetups
#: i18n/en.yaml:58
msgid "Meetups"
msgstr "Pertemuan"

#. home.activities.meetups.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:60
msgid ""
"Let's celebrate KDE's 25th Anniversary together! Join the meetups and get "
"together with fellow Community members, make friends, and explore similar "
"interests. Events are happening, both online and in-person! You can join the "
"in-person events in Berlin, Malaga, Barcelona, Nurnberg, or Valencia or host "
"your own event in your city and meet for coffee or drinks."
msgstr ""
"Mari rayakan Hari Jadi KDE yang ke-25 bersama-sama! Bergabunglah dalam acara "
"pertemuan dan berkumpul dengan sesama anggota Komunitas, menjalin "
"pertemanan, dan mengeksplorasi minat yang sama. Berbagai acara sedang "
"berlangsung, baik secara online maupun langsung! Anda dapat bergabung dengan "
"acara langsung di Berlin, Malaga, Barcelona, Nurnberg, atau Valencia atau "
"mengadakan acara Anda sendiri di kota Anda dan bertemu untuk minum kopi atau "
"minuman."

#. home.activities.meetups.more
#: i18n/en.yaml:67
msgid "Find a meetup near you!"
msgstr "Temukan acara pertemuan di dekat Anda!"

#. home.activities.AMA
#: i18n/en.yaml:70
msgid "Reddit AMA"
msgstr "Reddit AMA"

#. home.activities.AMA.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:72
msgid ""
"Nate Graham (developer and author of _This Week in KDE_), Aleix Pol "
"(President of KDE), and Lydia Pintscher (Vice President) will be answering "
"all your questions on [Reddit](https://reddit.com/r/kde) live on Sunday, "
"October 17th at 16:00 UTC. Don't miss it!"
msgstr ""
"Nate Graham (pengembang dan penulis _This Week in KDE_), Aleix Pol (Presiden "
"KDE), dan Lydia Pintscher (Wakil Presiden) akan menjawab semua pertanyaan "
"Anda di [Reddit](https://reddit.com/r/kde) secara langsung pada hari Minggu, "
"17 Oktober pukul 16:00 UTC. Jangan sampai ketinggalan!"

#. home.activities.AMA.end
#: i18n/en.yaml:77
msgid ""
"But you can still visit [KDE's subreddit](https://reddit.com/r/kde) and "
"receive up to date news, interact with KDE contributors, and participate in "
"lively discussions!"
msgstr ""
"Namun, Anda masih bisa mengunjungi [subreddit KDE](https://reddit.com/r/kde) "
"dan mendapatkan berita terbaru, berinteraksi dengan kontributor KDE, dan "
"berpartisipasi dalam diskusi yang hidup!"

#. home.activities.AMA.button
#: i18n/en.yaml:81
msgid "Visit r/kde"
msgstr "Kunjungi r/kde"

#. home.Plasma
#: i18n/en.yaml:84
msgid "Plasma - 25th Anniversary Edition"
msgstr "Plasma - Edisi Ulang Tahun ke-25"

#. home.Plasma.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:86
msgid ""
"<p>In time to celebrate KDE's birthday, Plasma renews its looks performance "
"and speed. You get a new wallpaper, an updated theme, extra speed, increased "
"reliability and new features.</p>\n"
"<p>Find out about all the details that make the new Plasma so deserving of "
"this 25th Anniversary on <a href='https://kde.org/announcements/"
"plasma/5/5.23.0/'>the release's announcement page</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dalam rangka merayakan ulang tahun KDE, Plasma memperbaharui penampilan "
"dan kecepatannya. Anda mendapatkan wallpaper baru, tema yang diperbarui, "
"kecepatan ekstra, peningkatan keandalan, dan fitur-fitur baru.</p>\n"
"<p>Cari tahu tentang semua detail yang membuat Plasma baru sangat layak "
"untuk merayakan ulang tahun ke-25 ini di <a href='https://kde.org/"
"announcements/plasma/5/5.23.0/'>halaman pengumuman rilis</a>.</p>"

#. home.plasma.see-announcement
#: i18n/en.yaml:95
msgid "See Announcement"
msgstr "Lihat Pengumuman"

#. home.history
#: i18n/en.yaml:98
msgid "The History of KDE"
msgstr "Sejarah KDE"

#. home.history.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:100
msgid ""
"The history of KDE is a fascinating one. In this section, apart from "
"learning about how things started (and how they are going), you will be able "
"to see what things looked like as they evolved and actually test-drive some "
"of KDE's most iconic desktops through the ages."
msgstr ""
"Sejarah KDE adalah sejarah yang menarik. Pada bagian ini, selain mempelajari "
"tentang bagaimana segala sesuatunya dimulai (dan bagaimana perjalanannya), "
"Anda akan dapat melihat seperti apa perkembangannya dan mencoba beberapa "
"desktop KDE yang paling ikonik selama bertahun-tahun."

