#. home.history.timeline
#: i18n/en.yaml:142
msgid "The KDE Timeline"
msgstr "Linimasa KDE"

#. home.history.timeline.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:144
msgid ""
"<p>As is well known, the Universe was born 14 billion years ago. Then "
"nothing much happened until KDE popped into existence on the 14th of October "
"of 1996... That's when stuff really kicked off.</p>\n"
"<p>Delve deep into KDE's history at our updated KDE Timeline.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Seperti diketahui, alam semesta lahir 14 milyar tahun yang lalu. Kemudian "
"tidak banyak yang terjadi hingga KDE muncul pada tanggal 14 Oktober 1996... "
"Saat itulah segala sesuatunya benar-benar dimulai.</p>\n"
"<p>Lihat lebih jauh ke dalam sejarah KDE di Linimasa KDE yang telah kami "
"perbaharui.</p>"

#. home.history.timeline.link
#: i18n/en.yaml:150
msgid "Visit the timeline"
msgstr "Kunjungi linimasa"

#. home.history.gallery
#: i18n/en.yaml:154
msgid "Gallery"
msgstr "Galeri"

#. home.history.gallery.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:156
msgid "Check out what things were like across the 25 years of KDE's existence."
msgstr "Lihat apa saja yang terjadi selama 25 tahun keberadaan KDE."

#. home.history.gallery.CTA
#: i18n/en.yaml:159
msgid ""
"Have you got pictures or videos of the KDE Community you would like to show "
"the world? <a href='mailto:press@kde.org'>Write to us!</a> We'd love to "
"display your contribution in our gallery!"
msgstr ""
"Apakah Anda memiliki foto atau video Komunitas KDE yang ingin Anda tunjukkan "
"kepada dunia? <a href='mailto:press@kde.org'>Kirimkan kepada kami!</a> Kami "
"ingin menampilkan kontribusi Anda di galeri kami!"

#. home.history.gallery.biggerimage
