#. home.history.inthewild
#: i18n/en.yaml:204
msgid "KDE in the Wild"
msgstr "KDE di Alam Bebas"

#. home.history.inthewild.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:206
msgid ""
"KDE's desktop and its applications have popped up in quite a few weird "
"places over the years. From the _Hadron Collider_ to _Heroes_, KDE has made "
"its way into all sorts of industries, organizations, films and TV shows. "
"Here are just a few of KDE's most notable star moments:"
msgstr ""
"Desktop KDE dan aplikasinya telah muncul di beberapa tempat yang aneh selama "
"bertahun-tahun. Dari _Hadron Collider_ hingga _Heroes_, KDE telah masuk ke "
"berbagai macam industri, organisasi, film, dan acara TV. Berikut ini adalah "
"beberapa momen penting KDE yang paling terkenal:"

#. home.history.inthewild.CTA
#: i18n/en.yaml:211
msgid ""
"Have you seen other instances of KDE running in an interesting place or on a "
"TV show or in a movie? <a href='mailto:press@kde.org'>Let us know</a>! If "
"possible, send us a pic too, so we can share it with the rest of the world."
msgstr ""
"Pernahkah Anda melihat contoh lain dari KDE yang berjalan di tempat yang "
"menarik atau di acara TV atau film? <a href='mailto:press@kde.org'>Beritahu "
"kami!</a> Jika memungkinkan, kirimkan juga fotonya kepada kami, agar kami "
"dapat membagikannya ke seluruh dunia."

#. home.history.inthewild.ligo
#: i18n/en.yaml:216
msgid ""
"2018 - KDE 4 at [LIGO Hanford Observatory](https://www.ligo.caltech.edu/WA) "
"(big screen). [Source](https://twitter.com/LIGOWA/"
"status/1068552370013913089). Thanks Tóth Bálint."
msgstr ""
"2018 - KDE 4 di [LIGO Hanford Observatory](https://www.ligo.caltech.edu/WA) "
"(layar lebar). [Sumber](https://twitter.com/LIGOWA/"
"status/1068552370013913089). Terima kasih Tóth Bálint."

#. home.history.inthewild.nasa
#: i18n/en.yaml:221
msgid ""
"2019 - The first images from Mars sent by NASA's InSight lander were "
"displayed to the world using KDE 4. Image courtesy of NASA."
msgstr ""
"2019 - Gambar pertama dari Mars yang dikirim oleh pendarat InSight NASA "
"ditampilkan ke dunia menggunakan KDE 4. Gambar milik NASA."

#. home.history.inthewild.sincrotron
#: i18n/en.yaml:225
msgid ""
"2019 - In the ALBA Synchrotron, located near Barcelona, Spain, they shoot "
"electrons along an accelerator to produce light for studies in different "
"fields. Photo by Sergi Blanch-Torné. [Source](https://dot.kde.org/2019/07/19/"
"powered-plasma-alba-synchrotron-barcelona-spain)."
msgstr ""
"2019 - Di ALBA Synchrotron, yang terletak di dekat Barcelona, Spanyol, "
"mereka menembakkan elektron di sepanjang akselerator untuk menghasilkan "
"cahaya untuk penelitian di berbagai bidang. Foto oleh Sergi Blanch-Torné. "
"[Sumber](https://dot.kde.org/2019/07/19/powered-plasma-alba-synchrotron-"
"barcelona-spain)."

#. home.history.inthewild.cern
#: i18n/en.yaml:230
msgid ""
"2014 - Plasma is used extensively throughout CERN, the place where the World "
"Wide Web and the Large Hadron Collider were born. In this case, we see KDE 4 "
"being used at a control station for a particle accelerator at Adlershof "
"Technology Park, Germany. Photo courtesy of Thomas Weissel."
msgstr ""
"2014 - Plasma digunakan secara luas di seluruh CERN, tempat di mana World "
"Wide Web dan Large Hadron Collider lahir. Dalam kasus ini, kita melihat KDE "
"4 digunakan di stasiun kontrol untuk akselerator partikel di Adlershof "
"Technology Park, Jerman. Foto milik Thomas Weissel."

#. home.history.inthewild.nerc
#: i18n/en.yaml:236
msgid ""
"2021 - NERC's Space Geodesy Facility fires lasers at satellites to check "
"their position to a high degree of precision. Scientists use a wide range of "
"KDE software products on their workstations, including Plasma and Konsole. "
"[Source](https://youtu.be/vdvIY0CJaXw)."
msgstr ""
"2021 - Fasilitas Geodesi Antariksa NERC menembakkan laser ke satelit untuk "
"memeriksa posisi mereka dengan tingkat presisi yang tinggi. Para ilmuwan "
"menggunakan berbagai macam produk perangkat lunak KDE di workstation mereka, "
"termasuk Plasma dan Konsole. [Sumber](https://youtu.be/vdvIY0CJaXw)."

#. home.history.inthewild.kerala
#: i18n/en.yaml:243
msgid ""
"2017 - KDE's software, including the Plasma desktop, is used extensively "
"throughout Kerala's educational system and is preinstalled on laptops pupils "
"use. [Source](https://kite.kerala.gov.in/KITE/index.php/welcome/"
"gallery_view/15)."
msgstr ""
"2017 - Perangkat lunak KDE, termasuk desktop Plasma, digunakan secara luas "
"di seluruh sistem pendidikan Kerala dan sudah terinstal di laptop yang "
"digunakan siswa. [Sumber](https://kite.kerala.gov.in/KITE/index.php/welcome/"
"gallery_view/15)."

#. home.history.inthewild.24
#: i18n/en.yaml:248
msgid ""
"2003 - The good guys (as long as you consider CIA operatives \"good\") got "
"to use KDE 3.0 in _24_ and it helped them to correctly identify who is "
"probably the busiest spy in the agency, one Mr Jack Bauer, as he entered the "
"HQ in Season 3, Episode 1. Source: Netflix. Thanks Eike Hein."
msgstr ""
"2003 - Orang-orang baik (selama Anda menganggap agen CIA \"baik\") dapat "
"menggunakan KDE 3.0 di _24_ dan membantu mereka untuk mengidentifikasi "
"dengan tepat, orang yang mungkin merupakan mata-mata paling sibuk di agensi "
"tersebut, yaitu Mr Jack Bauer, saat ia memasuki markas besar pada Season 3, "
"Episode 1. Sumber: Netflix. Terima kasih Eike Hein."

#. home.history.inthewild.heroes
#: i18n/en.yaml:253
msgid ""
"2006 - The wildly popular series _Heroes_ showed a character using KDE 3 "
"apps and themes (Kicker, KMenu applet, Kopete, KMix, Keramik) in an episode "
"that featured an intense chat session. [Source and more pics](http://www."
"eikehein.com/kde/heroes/). Thanks Eike Hein."
msgstr ""
"2006 - Serial _Heroes_ yang sangat populer menunjukkan karakter yang "
"menggunakan aplikasi dan tema KDE 3 (Kicker, applet KMenu, Kopete, KMix, "
"Keramik) dalam sebuah episode yang menampilkan sesi obrolan yang intens. "
"[Sumber dan foto-foto lainnya](http://www.eikehein.com/kde/heroes/). Terima "
"kasih Eike Hein."

#. home.history.inthewild.dexter
#: i18n/en.yaml:258
msgid ""
"2006 - KDE 3 pops up again in the also popular, albeit darker, _Dexter_ in "
"season 1, episode 8, running on the laptop of a dodgy psychiatrist. Source: "
"Amazon Prime. Thanks Aaron Seigo."
msgstr ""
"2006 - KDE 3 muncul lagi dalam serial yang juga populer, meskipun lebih "
"gelap, _Dexter_ di musim 1, episode 8, yang berjalan di laptop seorang "
"psikiater yang cerdik. Sumber: Amazon Prime. Terima kasih Aaron Seigo."

#. home.history.inthewild.gravity
#: i18n/en.yaml:262
msgid ""
"2013 - Alfonso Cuarón's smash hit movie _Gravity_, starring Sandra Bullock "
"and George Clooney, may have had wonky physics, but its visual production "
"was impeccable, thanks, in part, to Plasma 4, seen here running the software "
"used by the visual effects artists. [Source and more pics](https://blogs.kde."
"org/2014/02/09/kde-plasma-movies). Thanks Eike Hein."
msgstr ""
"2013 - Film sukses Alfonso Cuarón, _Gravity_, yang dibintangi oleh Sandra "
"Bullock dan George Clooney, mungkin memiliki fisika yang janggal, namun "
"produksi visualnya sangat sempurna, sebagian berkat Plasma 4, yang terlihat "
"di sini menjalankan perangkat lunak yang digunakan oleh para seniman efek "
"visual. [Sumber dan foto-foto lainnya](https://blogs.kde.org/2014/02/09/kde-"
"plasma-movies). Terima kasih Eike Hein."

#. home.history.inthewild.thehobbit
#: i18n/en.yaml:268
msgid ""
"2014 - Weta Digital's animation unit used KDE Plasma to produce motion "
"capture for The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug. Next time you see some "
"dwarves rolling down the river you can be assured that the smooth animation "
"was done with Plasma 4. [Source](https://youtu.be/U_usC2EQcDo)."
msgstr ""
"2014 - Unit animasi Weta Digital menggunakan KDE Plasma untuk memproduksi "
"motion capture untuk film The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug. Berikutnya "
"saat Anda melihat beberapa kurcaci berguling-guling di sungai, Anda dapat "
"yakin bahwa animasi yang halus itu dibuat dengan Plasma 4. [Sumber](https://"
"youtu.be/U_usC2EQcDo)."

#. home.history.inthewild.avatar
#: i18n/en.yaml:273
msgid ""
"2019 - From Middle Earth to Pandora: KDE's Plasma desktop and tools were "
"also used during the filming of James Cameron's _Avatar_. [Source](https://"
"youtu.be/bibZyMjY2K4?t=1975)."
msgstr ""
"2019 - Dari Bumi Tengah ke Pandora: Desktop dan alat bantu Plasma KDE juga "
"digunakan selama pembuatan film _Avatar_ karya James Cameron. [Sumber]"
"(https://youtu.be/bibZyMjY2K4?t=1975)."

#. home.support
#: i18n/en.yaml:278
msgid "Support KDE!"
msgstr "Dukung KDE!"

#. home.support.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:280
msgid ""
"<p>Like many Free Software projects, at KDE we rely on volunteers and "
"donations to carry out our work. Volunteers develop, contribute media, "
"translate, promote, and help implement KDE software. Donations help us with "
"all the operational costs of running a non-profit with thousands of members."
"</p>\n"
"<p>You can find out how volunteers work together and monetary resources are "
"allocated by taking a look at our <a href='https://ev.kde.org/"
"reports/'>yearly reports</a>.</p>\n"
"<p>You can contribute too! Here are some ways you can help us:</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Seperti kebanyakan proyek Perangkat Lunak Bebas, di KDE kami mengandalkan "
"sukarelawan dan donasi untuk menjalankan pekerjaan kami. Para relawan "
"mengembangkan, menyumbangkan media, menerjemahkan, mempromosikan, dan "
"membantu mengimplementasikan perangkat lunak KDE. Donasi membantu kami "
"dengan semua biaya operasional untuk menjalankan organisasi nirlaba dengan "
"ribuan anggota.</p>\n"
"<p>Anda dapat mengetahui bagaimana para sukarelawan bekerja sama dan sumber "
"daya keuangan dialokasikan dengan melihat <a href='https://ev.kde.org/"
"reports/'>laporan tahunan</a> kami.</p>\n"
"<p>Anda juga dapat berkontribusi! Berikut adalah beberapa cara yang dapat "
"Anda lakukan untuk membantu kami:</p>"

#. home.support.25425
#: i18n/en.yaml:292
msgid "\"25 for 25\" Fundraising Campaign"
msgstr "Kampanye Penggalangan Dana \"25 untuk 25\""

#. home.support.25425.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:294
msgid ""
"For our 25th Anniversary, we are running a special _25 for 25_ fundraising "
"campaign! Show your ❤️‍for KDE by donating $ 25 or € 25!"
msgstr ""
"Untuk merayakan ulang tahun ke-25, kami mengadakan kampanye penggalangan "
"dana _25 untuk 25_ khusus! Tunjukkan ❤️‍kepada KDE dengan mendonasikan $ 25 "
"atau € 25!"

#. home.support.25425.button
#: i18n/en.yaml:297
msgid "Donate 25 for 25"
msgstr "Donasi 25 untuk 25"

#. home.support.donations
#: i18n/en.yaml:300
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Donasi"

#. home.support.donations.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:302
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "You can <a href='https://kde.org/community/donations/'>make a donation of "
#| "the quantity of your choice</a> or become a <a href='https://relate.kde."
#| "org/'>KDE Supporting Member</a> and donate a yearly amount to KDE. Every "
#| "bit helps!"
msgid ""
"You can <a href='https://kde.org/community/donations/'>make a donation of "
"the quantity of your choice</a> or become a <a href='https://kde.org/"
"community/donations/'>KDE Supporting Member</a> and donate a yearly amount "
"to KDE. Every bit helps!"
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat <a href='https://kde.org/community/donations/'>memberikan donasi "
"dalam jumlah yang Anda pilih</a> atau menjadi <a href='https://relate.kde."
"org/'>Anggota Pendukung KDE</a> dan mendonasikan sejumlah uang tahunan "
"kepada KDE. Setiap bantuan akan sangat membantu!"

#. home.support.donations.button
#: i18n/en.yaml:307
msgid "Donate"
msgstr "Donasi"

#. home.support.contribute.kontributor
#: i18n/en.yaml:310
msgid "Over the years more than<br><strong>7000 Kontributors</strong> joined"
msgstr ""
"Selama bertahun-tahun lebih dari <br><strong>7000 Kontributor</strong> telah "
"bergabung"

#. home.support.contribute.learn
#: i18n/en.yaml:312
msgid "Learn how to get involved"
msgstr "Pelajari cara untuk terlibat"

#. home.support.contribute
#: i18n/en.yaml:314
msgid "25 Ways to Contribute"
msgstr "25 Cara untuk Berkontribusi"

#. home.support.contribute.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:316
msgid ""
"<p>Becoming a KDE volunteer keeps the Community and our software alive. To "
"celebrate KDE's 25th anniversary, we have compiled a list of 25 things you "
"can do for KDE and Nate Graham has turned the list into <a href='https://"
"pointieststick.com/2021/10/13/25-ways-you-can-contribute-to-kde/'>an "
"entertaining and informative article</a> with tons of links to resources.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Menjadi relawan KDE akan membuat Komunitas dan perangkat lunak kami tetap "
"hidup. Untuk merayakan ulang tahun ke-25 KDE, kami telah menyusun daftar 25 "
"hal yang dapat Anda lakukan untuk KDE dan Nate Graham telah mengubah daftar "
"tersebut menjadi <a href='https://pointieststick.com/2021/10/13/25-ways-you-"
"can-contribute-to-kde/'>sebuah artikel yang menghibur dan informatif </a> "
"dengan banyak tautan ke berbagai sumber daya.</p>"

#. home.support.contribute.list
#: i18n/en.yaml:322
msgid ""
"<p>This is a brief summary:</p>\n"
"<ol> <li>Application development</li> <li>Web development</li> <li>Software "
"testing</li> <li><a href='https://bugs.kde.org'>Bug reporting</a></li> "
"<li>Bug triaging</li> <li>Sending code fixes and new features</li> "
"<li>Enabling <I>User Feedback</I> for Plasma on <I>System Settings</I></li> "
"<li><a href='https://community.kde.org/Get_Involved/"
"translation'>Translating</a></li> <li><a href='https://community.kde.org/"
"Get_Involved/design'>Visual designing</a></li> <li><a href='https://t.me/"
"kdeusability'>User experience (UX) designing</a></li> <li><a href='https://"
"community.kde.org/Promo'>Promoting and doing marketing</a></li> <li>Working "
"on tasks on <a href='https://phabricator.kde.org'>KDE's Phabricator</a></li> "
"<li>Producing and editing videos for KDE's social media accounts</li> "
"<li>Writing and updating documentation and manuals</li> <li>Writing <a "
"href='https://community.kde.org/Main_Page'>wiki articles</a></li> "
"<li>Organizing events</li> <li>Participating in events</li> <li>Answering "
"users' questions on the <a href='https://forum.kde.org'>forum</a> or <a "
"href='https://www.reddit.com/r/kde/'>Reddit</a></li> <li>Promoting KDE in "
"your local community/school/business/family</li> <li>Evangelizing about KDE "
"on the Internet</li> <li>Following, sharing and interacting with posts on "
"KDE's social media: <ul> <li><a href='https://www.facebook.com/"
"kde'>Facebook</a></li> <li><a href='https://www.linkedin.com/company/"
"kde/'>LinkedIn</a> </li> <li><a href='https://twitter.com/kdecommunity'>KDE "
"Community Twitter</a></li> <li><a href='https://twitter.com/Akademy'>Akademy "
"Twitter</a></li> <li><a href='https://www.instagram.com/"
"kdecommunity/'>Instagram</a></li> <li><a href='https://tube.kockatoo.org/a/"
"kde_community/'>PeerTube</a></li> <li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/c/"
"KdeOrg/videos'>YouTube</a></li> <li><a href='https://vk.com/kde_ru'>VK</a></"
"li> <li><a href='https://joindiaspora.com/u/kdecommunity'>Diaspora</a></li> "
"<li><a href='https://mastodon.technology/@kde'>Mastodon</a></li> </ul> "
"<li>Sharing links pointing to KDE websites and social media on other "
"platforms</li> <li>Writing posts or making videos about KDE for your "
"personal blog post, social media and YouTube/PeerTube channels</li> "
"<li>Using <a href='https://apps.kde.org'>KDE software</a></li> <li>Packaging "
"KDE software for your distro/app store</li> </ol>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Berikut ini adalah ringkasan singkatnya:</p>\n"
"<ol> <li>Pengembangan aplikasi</li> <li>Pengembangan web</li> <li>Pengujian "
"perangkat lunak</li> <li><a href='https://bugs.kde.org'>Pelaporan bug</a></"
"li> <li>Triase bug</li> <li>Mengirim perbaikan kode dan fitur baru</li> "
"<li>Mengaktifkan <I>Umpan Balik Pengguna</I> untuk Plasma pada <I>Pengaturan "
"Sistem</I></li> <li><a href='https://community.kde.org/Get_Involved/"
"translation'>Menerjemahkan</a></li> <li><a href='https://community.kde.org/"
"Get_Involved/design'>Mendesain visual</a></li> <li><a href='https://t.me/"
"kdeusability'>Mendesain pengalaman pengguna (UX)</a></li> <li><a "
"href='https://community.kde.org/Promo'>Mempromosikan dan melakukan "
"pemasaran</a></li> <li>Mengerjakan tugas di <a href='https://phabricator.kde."
"org'>Phabricator KDE</a></li> <li>Memproduksi dan mengedit video untuk akun "
"media sosial KDE</li> <li>Menulis dan memperbarui dokumentasi dan panduan</"
"li> <li>Menulis <a href='https://community.kde.org/Main_Page'>artikel wiki</"
"a></li> <li>Mengorganisir acara</li> <li>Berpartisipasi dalam acara</li> "
"<li>Menjawab pertanyaan pengguna di situs <a href='https://forum.kde."
"org'>forum</a> atau <a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/kde/'>Reddit</a></li> "
"<li>Mempromosikan KDE di komunitas/sekolah/bisnis/keluarga Anda</li> "
"<li>Mengabarkan tentang KDE di Internet</li> <li>Mengikuti, berbagi, dan "
"berinteraksi dengan postingan di media sosial KDE: <ul> <li><a href='https://"
"www.facebook.com/kde'>Facebook</a></li> <li><a href='https://www.linkedin."
"com/company/kde/'>LinkedIn</a> </li> <li><a href='https://twitter.com/"
"kdecommunity'>KDE Community Twitter</a></li> <li><a href='https://twitter."
"com/Akademy'>Akademy Twitter</a></li> <li><a href='https://www.instagram.com/"
"kdecommunity/'>Instagram</a></li> <li><a href='https://tube.kockatoo.org/a/"
"kde_community/'>PeerTube</a></li> <li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/c/"
"KdeOrg/videos'>YouTube</a></li> <li><a href='https://vk.com/kde_ru'>VK</a></"
"li> <li><a href='https://joindiaspora.com/u/kdecommunity'>Diaspora</a></li> "
"<li><a href='https://mastodon.technology/@kde'>Mastodon</a></li> </ul> "
"<li>Bagikan tautan yang mengarah ke situs web KDE dan media sosial di "
"platform lain</li> <li>Menulis postingan atau membuat video tentang KDE "
"untuk postingan blog pribadi, media sosial, dan saluran YouTube/PeerTube "
"Anda</li> <li>Menggunakan <a href='https://apps.kde.org'>perangkat lunak "
"KDE</a></li> <li>Mengemas perangkat lunak KDE untuk distro/toko aplikasi "
"Anda</li> </ol>"

#. home.support.companies
#: i18n/en.yaml:365
msgid "Companies"
msgstr "Perusahaan"

#. home.support.companies.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:367
msgid ""
"Are you a manager in a company that finds our work useful? Let's develop "
"better code together! Many companies encourage their developers to "
"contribute to KDE's software. You can too."
msgstr ""
"Apakah Anda seorang manajer di sebuah perusahaan yang merasa pekerjaan kami "
"berguna? Mari kembangkan kode yang lebih baik bersama-sama! Banyak "
"perusahaan mendorong pengembang mereka untuk berkontribusi pada perangkat "
"lunak KDE. Anda juga bisa."

#. home.support.companies.button
#: i18n/en.yaml:371
msgid "Get in touch"
msgstr "Hubungi kami"

#. home.support.companies.patron
#: i18n/en.yaml:373
msgid ""
"You can also sponsor our activities or, better yet, become <a href='https://"
"ev.kde.org/getinvolved/supporting-members/'>a KDE patron</a>!"
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat mensponsori kegiatan kami atau, lebih baik lagi, menjadi <a "
"href='https://ev.kde.org/getinvolved/supporting-members/'>pendukung KDE</a>!"

#. home.merch
#: i18n/en.yaml:378
msgid "Merch!"
msgstr "Pernak-pernik!"

#. home.merch.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:380
msgid ""
"Celebrate the occasion with KDE 25th Anniversary T-shirts and stickers! "
"Remember: Freewear donates to KDE with every purchase."
msgstr ""
"Rayakan acara ini dengan kaos dan stiker Peringatan 25 Tahun KDE! Ingat: "
"Setiap pembelian Freewear akan didonasikan kepada KDE."

